{
  "_comment": [
    "Every block the three shipped starter islands are made of, with the passability the game",
    "would derive for it (SnapshotBlockVolume#passabilityOf: empty collision is PASSABLE, a full",
    "cube is BLOCKING, anything else is PARTIAL) and the tags the shipped tag files and vanilla give",
    "it. Read by SoulIslandVolume for the regression corpus (#139). A template block missing from",
    "here fails the corpus with a message naming it - add it, do not guess in Java.",
    "",
    "passability_by picks the passability from one block state property, for the few blocks whose",
    "shape depends on their state: a one-layer snow cover has no collision at all, a double slab is a",
    "full cube."
  ],

